  "origin": "Older Danish poetry from the Kalliope digital library, which states that its texts are public domain. DFM drew the texts from the source repository github.com/thabz/Kalliope at revision 71b9deb. Kalliope is described as a growing collection rather than a complete record of Danish poetry. 22.27K samples, 14.01M Llama-3 tokens; document created-dates range as far back as 1772.",
